WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.146
Start at Home: the weekly overview and decisions waiting for you.
Fictional business and sample data.

00:00:04.146 --> 00:00:10.157
Open Leads. The board groups records by priority
and shows the reason behind each rating.

00:00:10.157 --> 00:00:15.213
Switch to Table to compare the records
and see when each contact was last reached.

00:00:15.213 --> 00:00:20.218
Open Approvals. Read the proposed action
and the reason your agent recommends it.

00:00:20.218 --> 00:00:23.242
Choose an email reply: approve, request changes, or decline.
This demo does not send any messages.
